WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.993
Cinderella felt awful.

2
00:00:09.994 --> 00:00:13.606
Her stepsisters were at the fancy ball.

3
00:00:13.607 --> 00:00:15.740
But she was home alone.

4
00:00:15.741 --> 00:00:18.329
"I wish I could go to the ball."

5
00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.450
Cinderella wiped away her tears.

6
00:00:21.451 --> 00:00:24.732
"I must not feel sorry for myself," she said.

7
00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:34.047
"I have lots of work to do."

8
00:00:34.048 --> 00:00:38.284
Cinderella got a rag and a bucket.

9
00:00:38.285 --> 00:00:40.654
She got down on her hands and knees.

10
00:00:40.655 --> 00:00:45.623
And she began to scrub.

11
00:00:45.624 --> 00:00:47.599
Cinderella heard something.

12
00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:51.422
"What was that?" she thought.

13
00:00:51.423 --> 00:00:58.434
She went outside.

14
00:00:58.435 --> 00:01:01.444
There was a small woman at the fountain.

15
00:01:01.445 --> 00:01:06.004
She had sparkling wings.

16
00:01:06.005 --> 00:01:10.291
"Oops," she said. "I'm all wet!"

17
00:01:10.292 --> 00:01:15.956
Cinderella gasped. "W-who are you?"

18
00:01:15.957 --> 00:01:20.072
"I'm your fairy godmother," the woman said.

19
00:01:20.073 --> 00:01:24.401
She stood up and flapped her wings.

20
00:01:24.402 --> 00:01:28.455
The fairy flew over to Cinderella.

21
00:01:28.456 --> 00:01:32.570
"I'm here to check on you," she said.

22
00:01:32.571 --> 00:01:36.480
"I wanted to make sure you're okay."

23
00:01:36.481 --> 00:01:39.173
Cinderella stared in surprise.

24
00:01:39.174 --> 00:01:45.239
Suddenly she burst into tears.

25
00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:48.142
"My dear!" the fairy said.

26
00:01:48.143 --> 00:01:51.382
"What's wrong? Tell me!"

27
00:01:51.383 --> 00:01:54.250
"I'm not okay," Cinderella said.

28
00:01:54.251 --> 00:01:56.320
"My life is terrible!

29
00:01:56.321 --> 00:01:58.809
I work and work and work.

30
00:01:58.810 --> 00:02:01.060
And tonight . . ."

31
00:02:01.061 --> 00:02:05.527
"You want to go to the ball," the fairy said.

32
00:02:05.528 --> 00:02:09.561
Cinderella sniffed. "Yes, but—"

33
00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:18.418
The fairy smiled brightly. "Then you will go!"

